    "data": "Three real steps run A→B→C→D. Some steps come pre-bundled — 'Parse+Chart' does the first two at once, 'Chart+Report' does the last two. Associativity says HOW you group them never changes the result: f then (g then h) equals (f then g) then h. So several routes reach the true report — but two of the bundles are buggy and produce junk. Find ANY grouping of the faithful steps.",
